{"id":"n40045-1-6","stage":4,"title":"기립 · 起立","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40045-1-6-1","ko":"영화가 끝나니까 사람들이 기립 박수를 치더라.","zh":"电影结束后，大家都站起来鼓掌呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화가","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나니까","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기립","meaning":"起立","explanation":"기립：起立","readings":[{"term":"기립","audio":"/audio/d7e86bec71d0c01a2100.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40045","senseId":"1","lemma":"기립","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박수를","meaning":"鼓掌，拍手","explanation":"박수：鼓掌，拍手；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"박수","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57325","senseId":"1","lemma":"박수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치더라.","meaning":"拍打，鼓，击","explanation":"치다：拍打，鼓，击；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"2","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"d7e86bec71d0c01a","term":"기립","zh":"起立","audio":"/audio/d7e86bec71d0c01a2100.mp3","entryId":"40045","definition":"从座位上起来站着。","pronunciation":["기립"]},{"id":"221efccbb32544c1","term":"박수","zh":"鼓掌，拍手","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3","entryId":"57325","definition":"为表示高兴、祝贺、欢迎、称赞等或为打节拍而两手对击。","pronunciation":["박쑤"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"拍打，鼓，击","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"两手碰撞而发出声音。","pronunciation":["치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/35275f1cd34558acf8bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40045-1-6-2","ko":"자리에서 일어나서 박수를 칠 정도로 영화가 훌륭했나 보구나.","zh":"看来这部电影精彩到让人都要起身鼓掌了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자리에서","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어나서","meaning":"起，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"1","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박수를","meaning":"鼓掌，拍手","explanation":"박수：鼓掌，拍手；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"박수","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57325","senseId":"1","lemma":"박수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"칠","meaning":"拍打，鼓，击","explanation":"치다：拍打，鼓，击；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"2","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도로","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화가","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훌륭했나","meaning":"优秀，卓越","explanation":"훌륭하다：优秀，卓越；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"훌륭하다","audio":"/audio/086a96db168cd21a589e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73249","senseId":"1","lemma":"훌륭하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"由躺而坐或由坐而站。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"221efccbb32544c1","term":"박수","zh":"鼓掌，拍手","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3","entryId":"57325","definition":"为表示高兴、祝贺、欢迎、称赞等或为打节拍而两手对击。","pronunciation":["박쑤"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"拍打，鼓，击","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"两手碰撞而发出声音。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"086a96db168cd21a","term":"훌륭하다","zh":"优秀，卓越","audio":"/audio/086a96db168cd21a589e.mp3","entryId":"73249","definition":"非常好、出色，值得称赞。","pronunciation":["훌륭하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3a89037547e3456fc2e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.135,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40045","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来这部电影精彩到让人都要起身鼓掌了。","电影结束后，大家都站起来鼓掌呢。","听说智秀离家出走了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["电影结束后，大家都站起来鼓掌呢。","听说智秀离家出走了。","看来这部电影精彩到让人都要起身鼓掌了。"],"answer":2}]}
